OL,3,AInquest begins into death of Jason
OL,4,AArday
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest has begun into the death of
OL,7,FJason Arday, the former University of
OL,8,FCambridge professor at the centre of a
OL,9,Fplagiarism row.
OL,11,FHe was found dead at his home in London
OL,12,Fon 14 August, days after resigning from
OL,13,Fhis post.
OL,15,FHis appointment as Cambridge's youngest
OL,16,Fever black professor at the age of 37
OL,17,Fin 2023 was hailed at the time as a
OL,18,Fprogressive moment.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
